# Every pull request adds an entry to the same place in CHANGELOG.md, so two of
# them always conflicted there and each merge forced a rebase and a full CI run
# of every other open pull request. `union` keeps both sides' added lines.
# It also keeps both sides when two branches EDIT the same line: after merging,
# an edited entry can appear twice. Entries are added, not edited, so that is
# the accepted cost.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
